rule: TEST_DISABLED
title: A string skipif condition is the expression pytest evaluates, so a real platform gate earns COMPAT_GATE
origin: #263 S1; pytest 536252cb2e and 5715bbd6f5 spell their win32 gates as strings, with `sys` from pytest's namespace
=== before: tests/test_calc.py ===
import pytest

from app import total


def test_total():
    assert total(3) == 6
=== after: tests/test_calc.py ===
import pytest

from app import total


@pytest.mark.skipif("sys.platform == 'win32'", reason="POSIX only")
def test_total():
    assert total(3) == 6
